==International relations==
Navassa is classified as an [[w:Global city| Beta - World City]], according to the [[Loughborough University]] group's (GaWC) 2018 inventory. It has consistently ranked as one of the world's most livable cities. The city also hosts the [[Southern University]], the academic and research arm of the [[Southern Independent States Association]].
